{
  "_comment": "手工兜底模板，正常无需复制：任何产品带 enable_oskm_collect 编译后会按实际 out/<product> 自动生成 oskm/lsp/lsp-mcp.json 并软链到源码树根 .lsp-mcp.json，编译其他产品即自动切换；已建索引的产品间切换可用 build_index.py -i out/<product> --mcp-only 秒级重建配置。仅当从未运行过索引构建时才手工复制本文件到源码树根目录（命名 .lsp-mcp.json），并把 out/rk3568、warmup、clangd 路径替换为实际值，且必须从源码树根目录启动 opencode（相对路径按启动目录解析）；clangd 需 >= 20。",
  "servers": [
    {
      "id": "cpp",
      "extensions": [".c", ".h", ".cpp", ".hpp", ".cc", ".hh", ".cxx", ".hxx", ".c++", ".h++"],
      "languageIds": ["c", "cpp"],
      "command": "clangd",
      "args": [
        "--background-index",
        "--compile-commands-dir=out/rk3568",
        "-j=32",
        "--pch-storage=memory",
        "--limit-references=0",
        "--limit-results=0"
      ],
      "rootPatterns": [".clangd", "compile_commands.json"],
      "warmup": "base/startup/init/interfaces/innerkits/service_watcher/service_watcher.c"
    }
  ],
  "requestTimeout": 600000,
  "autoStart": true,
  "idleTimeout": 28800000,
  "logLevel": "info"
}
